{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PAYDAY 3 is a 1-to-4 player FPS where you live out the ultimate heist fantasy. Tackle jobs in stealth to empty vaults without leaving a trace. Or charge in loud, fight off relentless enemies, and escape with the big score. A deep skill tree, extensive weapon selection and unlockable modifications provide near endless variety, no matter your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/cf719c8484b5105d67e6379d6c99f4ae.avif?t=1776766718\" alt=\"Legendary Heisters\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/cf719c8484b5105d67e6379d6c99f4ae.webp?t=1776766718 width=1560 height=525 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on the mask and become a legend. After years off the grid, the Payday Gang returns to unleash an epic crime wave across New York City. Join the world\u2019s most infamous crew with your customized look, loadout and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/997ae848439c3c8a7eef6d7e1dc16e88.avif?t=1776766718\" alt=\"Give in to Greed\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/997ae848439c3c8a7eef6d7e1dc16e88.webp?t=1776766718 width=1560 height=525 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this life of crime, the only limit is your own ambition. Use cash from heists and challenges to fill your armory with powerful new weapons. Unlock specialized skills and gadgets to enhance your favorite tactics. Gotta spend money to make money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/15eef69f674ebe6d85062a5b463d4760.avif?t=1776766718\" alt=\"Precision or Chaos\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/15eef69f674ebe6d85062a5b463d4760.webp?t=1776766718 width=1560 height=525 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meticulous preparation or raw violence: The choice is yours. PAYDAY gives you the tools to avoid escalation, but if the alarm goes off, the heist must go on. Cops, SWAT and Special Units will combine forces to take you out. What will your strategy be?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/ea71fe2080f6737b6538c6b9cc3ef730.avif?t=1776766718\" alt=\"Better Together\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/ea71fe2080f6737b6538c6b9cc3ef730.webp?t=1776766718 width=1560 height=525 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect heist demands coordination. Bots will always have your back, but nothing beats a well-organized team of players. Whether you split up or stick together, you\u2019ll need to overcome escalating threats as one. In PAYDAY 3, your crew is your greatest weapon.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"f555f7e37d23e97ede7b19cf5a790969ab699819.jpg","localized_name":"No One Cared Who I Was...","name":"No One Cared Who I Was...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1272080/f555f7e37d23e97ede7b19cf5a790969ab699819.jpg"},{"icon":"4307cf52e1e23eb99ebd8e73165c9e2c3d89481e.jpg","localized_name":"Guns Don't Kill People...","name":"Guns Don't Kill People...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1272080/4307cf52e1e23eb99ebd8e73165c9e2c3d89481e.jpg"},{"icon":"ceb7ae83259e80de8c78ee3727aa8297837b3156.jpg","localized_name":"Danger, High Voltage","name":"Danger, High Voltage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1272080/ceb7ae83259e80de8c78ee3727aa8297837b3156.jpg"},{"icon":"17cd12e39900a3f250503c546192b92bc54fe1b5.jpg","localized_name":"Unlimited Power","name":"Unlimited Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1272080/17cd12e39900a3f250503c546192b92bc54fe1b5.jpg"},{"icon":"47f6a24119a1fdd933ebf49856f4912d26e7dc02.jpg","localized_name":"Kitted Out","name":"Kitted Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1272080/47f6a24119a1fdd933ebf49856f4912d26e7dc02.jpg"},{"icon":"8f75a446a82dc456b728aa58feae09c76375b09f.jpg","localized_name":"Arts and Crafts","name":"Arts and Crafts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1272080/8f75a446a82dc456b728aa58feae09c76375b09f.jpg"},{"icon":"e6446d02eda8b77ab4e4fdf81ba73aba00d308b0.jpg","localized_name":"Traffic Control","name":"Traffic Control","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1272080/e6446d02eda8b77ab4e4fdf81ba73aba00d308b0.jpg"},{"icon":"5bd08a5787c520f36e8681f283b052e778b1a20d.jpg","localized_name":"Crowd Control","name":"Crowd Control","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1272080/5bd08a5787c520f36e8681f283b052e778b1a20d.jpg"},{"icon":"646b1081bbcf8c0e0429817c403251cef377ac24.jpg","localized_name":"True Connoisseur","name":"True Connoisseur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1272080/646b1081bbcf8c0e0429817c403251cef377ac24.jpg"},{"icon":"ba4baa9aa636ca273a371385d059cdfb01930879.jpg","localized_name":"Art Critic","name":"Art Critic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1272080/ba4baa9aa636ca273a371385d059cdfb01930879.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1272080?t=1776766718","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/8948e9f470d79ab9c2b0707165f6a78ab5971670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1776766718","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/fd563a230d7fa67e412e9825ac93c327ba4b1831/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776766718","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/fd563a230d7fa67e412e9825ac93c327ba4b1831/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776766718","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"PAYDAY 3 contains repeated displays of gun violence, including the shooting of civilians and law enforcement. PAYDAY 3 references alcohol and tobacco as well as illegal drugs in a lighthearted way."},"detailed_description":"<h1>YEAR 1 EDITION</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/3ee6025171ec4ddb30a1919f39ff4133.avif?t=1776766718\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/3ee6025171ec4ddb30a1919f39ff4133.avif?t=1776766718 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>PAYDAY 3: Year 1 Edition</strong> offers everything needed to get started in the heisting world. The Year 1 Edition includes all major content releases, along with the many free updates and improvements released over the game\u2019s first year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The base game Payday 3 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Payday 3 Year 1 Pass: The Season Pass includes four major DLC bundles - Syntax Error, Boys in Blue, Houston Breakout and Fear &amp; Greed - each introducing a new heist, a variety of weapons, and numerous cosmetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preacher pack (including 1 outfit, 1 weapon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drifter pack (including 1 outfit, 1 weapon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heavy Hitter pack (including 1 outfit, 1 weapon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assassin pack (including 1 outfit, 1 weapon)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island skin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Sterling Mask</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skull of Liberty Mask and Golden Slate Gloves</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PAYDAY 3 is a 1-to-4 player FPS where you live out the ultimate heist fantasy. Tackle jobs in stealth to empty vaults without leaving a trace. Or charge in loud, fight off relentless enemies, and escape with the big score. A deep skill tree, extensive weapon selection and unlockable modifications provide near endless variety, no matter your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/cf719c8484b5105d67e6379d6c99f4ae.avif?t=1776766718\" alt=\"Legendary Heisters\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/cf719c8484b5105d67e6379d6c99f4ae.webp?t=1776766718 width=1560 height=525 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on the mask and become a legend. After years off the grid, the Payday Gang returns to unleash an epic crime wave across New York City. Join the world\u2019s most infamous crew with your customized look, loadout and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/997ae848439c3c8a7eef6d7e1dc16e88.avif?t=1776766718\" alt=\"Give in to Greed\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/997ae848439c3c8a7eef6d7e1dc16e88.webp?t=1776766718 width=1560 height=525 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this life of crime, the only limit is your own ambition. Use cash from heists and challenges to fill your armory with powerful new weapons. Unlock specialized skills and gadgets to enhance your favorite tactics. Gotta spend money to make money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/15eef69f674ebe6d85062a5b463d4760.avif?t=1776766718\" alt=\"Precision or Chaos\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/15eef69f674ebe6d85062a5b463d4760.webp?t=1776766718 width=1560 height=525 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meticulous preparation or raw violence: The choice is yours. PAYDAY gives you the tools to avoid escalation, but if the alarm goes off, the heist must go on. Cops, SWAT and Special Units will combine forces to take you out. What will your strategy be?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras/ea71fe2080f6737b6538c6b9cc3ef730.avif?t=1776766718\" alt=\"Better Together\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/extras_big/ea71fe2080f6737b6538c6b9cc3ef730.webp?t=1776766718 width=1560 height=525 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect heist demands coordination. Bots will always have your back, but nothing beats a well-organized team of players. Whether you split up or stick together, you\u2019ll need to overcome escalating threats as one. In PAYDAY 3, your crew is your greatest weapon.</p>","developers":["Starbreeze Studios"],"dlc":[4533420,4129170,3858460,3679630,3450550,2450711,3171970,3110530,3055010,2713010,3214920,3171980,2450696,2450693,2450690,3171990,2450697,2450694,2450691,3172010,3111880,2450695,2450692,2438800],"ext_user_account_notice":"Starbreeze Nebula (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1272080/d2f9d9bb92bda9eb6a451488d4ddeae460da9366/header.jpg?t=1776766718","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 STARBREEZE. Developed and published by STARBREEZE. Payday is a registered trademark of STARBREEZE. PAYDAY 3 uses the Unreal\u00ae Engine. Unreal\u00ae is a registered trademark or trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States of America and elsewhere. Unreal\u00ae Engine, Copyright 1998 \u2013 2026, Epic Games, Inc.<br />\r\nAll rights reserved. All other trademarks, logos and copyrights are property of their respective owners. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recom